  "access": {
    "level": "restricted",
    "note": "On a July 2, 2022 visit a locked gate on the access road blocked vehicles, and visitors walked about a mile from it. The 2022 post says vandals had cut the gate and a Forest Service crew seemed to have recently fixed it. A notice on that post says the area was closed as of July 20, 2024, due to the active Diamond Complex; no source read says when it reopened. No rentals are mentioned in the sources."
  },
